  m_text: "John Doe was arrested and charged with burglary for allegedly breaking
    into a convenience store at night when the store was closed, using a stone to
    smash a side window. The store owner who has run the store for over 30 years
    reported that several hundred dollars were taken from the cash register. He described
    the break-in as 'devastating', not just financially but emotionally, as the store
    is both his livelihood and a cornerstone of the neighborhood. Doe\u2019s annual
    income is $82,000"
